# VGC Core — native client-rects farbling (getBoundingClientRect / getClientRects)
# STATUS: ✅ VERIFIED — real, git-apply-able diff (built + validated on M151). getBoundingClientRect
# returns a farbled rect from a NATIVE getter (no JS override); a DETACHED element's rect is non-zero
# (0,0,0,0 farbled), which the JS layer uses to auto-detect native and skip its own client-rects
# spoof (stealth-extra __vgcRectsNative). Reuses --vgc-seed (already in kVgcSwitches, patch 02).
# Same algorithm shape as the JS (stealth-extra.ts): deterministic ~±1e-4 px per-metric offset.
diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/element.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/element.cc
